{"message":"The best currently verified sign-up bonus I found is the EcoCard promotion: earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 as a statement credit or Rho-Bank checking deposit—after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases during your first month. The offer runs through December 15, 2025, and requires the account to remain open and in good standing.

For comparison, the Silver Rewards Card previously offered a $500 statement credit after $2,000 in first-month spending, but that offer expired June 30, 2025. I couldn’t verify a current personal-card sign-up offer that exceeds the EcoCard bonus.

If you’re considering a business card, the Silver Zoom Card has a triple-cash-back promotion through December 31, 2025, though it’s an earnings multiplier rather than a one-time sign-up bonus. Would you prefer a personal or business card, and roughly how much could you spend in the first month?"}
